{
  "turns": [
    {
      "match": "re:^leitura",
      "steps": [
        {
          "type": "thinking",
          "text": "Vou ler o módulo atlas e conferir o beacon."
        },
        {
          "type": "tool",
          "name": "Bash",
          "input": {
            "command": "ls atlas"
          },
          "result": "index.ts\nutil.ts",
          "delayMs": 50
        },
        {
          "type": "tool",
          "name": "Bash",
          "input": {
            "command": "cat atlas/index.ts"
          },
          "result": "export const atlas = 1;",
          "delayMs": 50
        },
        {
          "type": "tool",
          "name": "Bash",
          "input": {
            "command": "cat beacon/missing.ts"
          },
          "result": "Exit code 1\ncat: beacon/missing.ts: No such file or directory",
          "isError": true,
          "delayMs": 50
        },
        {
          "type": "assistant",
          "text": "## Resumo do atlas\n\nA leitura do módulo **atlas** terminou. Veja a tabela e o código:\n\n| módulo | estado | notas |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| atlas | ok | sem pendências |\n| beacon | atenção | revisar timeout |\n| vega | ok | estável |\n\n```ts\nexport function sum(a: number, b: number): number {\n  return a + b;\n}\n```\n\n- primeiro item\n- segundo item com `código inline`"
        },
        {
          "type": "hook",
          "event": "Stop"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "match": "re:^oi",
      "steps": [
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "ms": 150
        },
        {
          "type": "assistant",
          "text": "Olá! Tudo certo por aqui."
        },
        {
          "type": "hook",
          "event": "Stop"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "default": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "type": "wait",
        "ms": 150
      },
      {
        "type": "assistant",
        "text": "OK"
      },
      {
        "type": "hook",
        "event": "Stop"
      }
    ]
  }
}
